# Markdown is hand-formatted, deliberately.
#
# Prettier pads every table cell out to the widest row, which turns a readable
# 90-column table into a 300-column one that nobody can edit in a diff, and it
# re-indents the trailing comments inside fenced code blocks — the aligned
# `// epoch MILLISECONDS` annotations in the README are the explanation, not
# decoration. Prose style is reviewable by eye; a missing `.js` extension is
# not, which is what the tooling is here for.
